cybagard design system
Copyright (c) 2026 cybagard. All rights reserved.

This licence covers the cybagard design system: the tokens, the component
CSS, the templates, the scripts, the documentation, and the logo files in
assets/logos/, including copies of these files that scripts/install.sh puts
in an assets/cybagard/ directory.

1. Permitted use

   cybagard may use, change and publish these files without limit.

   A copy of these files may be distributed only as part of a cybagard
   project: a website, application or repository that cybagard publishes or
   maintains. Such a copy must be unmodified, as installed by
   scripts/install.sh, and must keep this licence file next to it.

   Anyone may view, download and run a cybagard project that contains such a
   copy, for the purpose of using that project.

2. No other rights

   No other right is granted. In particular, you may not copy, change or
   reuse these files, or any part of them, in a project that is not a
   cybagard project, and you may not use them to create a design that
   imitates the cybagard brand.

   When a cybagard project is released under an open-source licence, that
   licence covers the project's own files. It does not cover the files under
   this licence, which are distributed with the project as a separate work.

3. Brand

   The name "cybagard", the segmented "C" mark and the logo files are the
   brand of cybagard. This licence grants no right to use them, except to
   refer accurately to cybagard and its projects. Do not use them to name,
   brand or promote another product, service or fork, or in a way that
   suggests that cybagard endorses it.

4. Third-party fonts

   The fonts in fonts/ (Space Grotesk and JetBrains Mono) are not covered by
   this licence. They are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; see
   fonts/OFL-SpaceGrotesk.txt and fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt.

5. No warranty

   THESE FILES ARE PROVIDED "AS IS", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR
